{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21819","headline":"村花晚 · 元稹","name":"村花晚","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三春已暮桃李伤，棠梨花白蔓菁黄。\n村中女儿争摘将，插刺头鬓相夸张。\n田翁蚕老迷臭香，晒暴𢽱𣀳熏衣\n非无後秀与孤芳，奈尔千株万顷之茫茫。\n天公此意何可量，长教尔辈时节长。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21819.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21819","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}